      "text": "The charged black hole of Reissner and Nordström. Hold its charge fixed, bring its mass down toward the charge, and zoom in on the horizon: in that limit its plane of $t$ and $r$ is this black hole, with the area of the sphere as the dilaton [mertens2023]."
