      "text": "The throat of the extreme Kerr black hole, anti-de Sitter space of two dimensions with a deformed sphere twisted over it. Its near-NHEK chart carries $r(r - 2k)$ where the static chart of this black hole has $r^2 - r_h^2$, the same factor after a shift of $r$ by $k$."
